Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.70,0:03:06.83,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}交わる時間上にない涙腺曲がる快楽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.83,0:03:10.29,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}吐き捨てる哀・怒を手に妬みとつないでる
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.91,0:03:15.00,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}映り気にしてる程見えない相違
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.00,0:03:19.13,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}価値観の連鎖を止めるフリー気取りの×
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.46,0:03:26.18,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}gravity-wall　{\fsp5}口づけを
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.51,0:03:30.39,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}I'm screaming something to you. Whatever, something to me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.39,0:03:34.65,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}ズレた答えをどけた先だけが
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.65,0:03:39.11,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}I'm screaming something to you. Whatever, something to me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.11,0:03:43.03,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}絡まってる裸足でも賭ける
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.03,0:03:46.41,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}Now I don't know what I really want
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.41,0:03:51.91,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}I still don't know how to escape from this beautiful trap
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.91,0:03:54.67,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}Don't know what I really want
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.67,0:04:00.17,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}I still don't know how to escape from this dangerous trap
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.22,0:04:04.80,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}Break your stereo days
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.80,0:04:10.31,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}空ほどいた太陽と羽の白が
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.31,0:04:12.98,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}Brave invisible world
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.98,0:04:17.44,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}無くした色たちを照らす
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.02,0:02:54.02,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.70,0:03:06.83,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}時間交錯 那催人淚下的快樂卻無處可尋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.83,0:03:10.29,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}捨棄哀·怒 緊握手中 與嫉妒相連
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.91,0:03:15.00,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}若隱若現的差異 令人在意
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.00,0:03:19.13,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}那自由的× 斬斷價值觀的連鎖
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.46,0:03:26.18,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}輕吻那重力之牆
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.51,0:03:30.39,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}我呼喊著你 不惜一切
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.39,0:03:34.65,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}只為追尋正確答案
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.65,0:03:39.11,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}我呼喊著你 不惜一切
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.11,0:03:43.03,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}甚至賭上那步履蹣跚的雙足
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.03,0:03:46.41,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}我不知何為所求
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.41,0:03:51.91,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}亦不知如何逃離這美麗陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.91,0:03:54.67,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}我不知何為所求
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.67,0:04:00.17,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}亦不知如何逃離這危險陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.22,0:04:04.80,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}打破你的日常
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.80,0:04:10.31,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}光羽輝映成純白 浸染天空
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.31,0:04:12.98,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}宏偉的虛擬世界
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.98,0:04:17.44,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}照亮失落的色彩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.44,0:04:19.48,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.57,0:22:29.32,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,走り出して急上昇　夢の中へ今日も{\fsp0}ride on
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.32,0:22:34.95,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,ズレてゆく想い　冷めてくスマイル　蹴り飛ばして {\fsp0}go way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.95,0:22:39.71,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,秘密じゃない　甘いロンリー　気づいてたみたい　そう{\fsp0}stand up
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.71,0:22:44.92,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,我がままに {\fsp0}so fly{\r}　ダメージキメたい　視線集めて {\fsp0}posing
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.92,0:22:50.09,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,絡みつくブルーな感情も　さらけだして　もっと{\fsp0}feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.09,0:22:55.93,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,手繰り寄せた{\fsp0}wave{\r}　駆け乗って　自分しか見れないストーリー
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.93,0:23:00.81,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,つま先伸ばし {\fsp0}catch my soul{\r}　間違い探し　恋に妄想
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.81,0:23:04.94,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,マワル世界　そのまま落ちてく
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.94,0:23:10.86,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,遠ざかる心に彷徨う　迷いは捨てて
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.86,0:23:15.49,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,もっと遠くまで行けるから {\fsp0}far away
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.49,0:23:21.12,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,なにも怖がらないで　今すぐ　夢の彼方へ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.12,0:23:25.21,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,はじけ飛んだ　その扉の向こうへ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.21,0:23:35.89,op-jp,NTP,0,0,0,,羽広げて {\fsp0}going road
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.89,0:23:35.89,ed-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.57,0:22:29.32,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,飛奔而出急劇上升 今天也向著夢想{\fsp0}ride on
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.32,0:22:34.95,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,堅定信念 保持微笑 勇往直前 {\fsp0}go way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.95,0:22:39.71,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,不是秘密 發現已孤身一人 {\fsp0}stand up
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.71,0:22:44.92,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,隨心所欲 {\fsp0}so fly{\r} 想打動人心 吸引目光吧 {\fsp0}posing
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.92,0:22:50.09,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,展露糾結抑鬱之情 多多{\fsp0}feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.09,0:22:55.93,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,牽出{\fsp0}wave{\r} 踏浪而行 只屬於自己的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.93,0:23:00.81,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,伸出手 {\fsp0}catch my soul{\r} 尋找差異 幻想著戀愛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.81,0:23:04.94,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,旋轉的世界就這樣落下
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.94,0:23:10.86,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,彷徨於遠去的心中 不再迷惘
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.86,0:23:15.49,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,還能走得更遠 {\fsp0}far away
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.49,0:23:21.12,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,不要害怕 立刻啟程 朝夢想進發
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.12,0:23:25.21,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,向著那扇門的另一側
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.21,0:23:35.89,op-cn,NTP,0,0,0,,展翅高飛吧 {\fsp0}going road
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:36.00,zhu,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.85,0:00:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼我會認識她
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.23,0:00:08.32,pm1,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(172,266)\frz4.622}這是新作 按照原來說的 給她取了一個星星的名字\N\N這可能是最後的作品了 謝謝大家對她的喜愛 再見
